  "notes": "Warm parchment (#f5f2eb) page with white cards and forest-green (#1f5a43) filled pill chips for active must-haves; burnt orange (#d4612a) reserved for primary commitment actions (Reserve, Compare) and saved hearts. Campground photos are flat vector landscape illustrations (mountains, pines, lake, tent) in varying sky tints. Amenity icons appear as small tinted squares in each card; a muted/amber icon marks partial matches (generator noise). Amber warning lines surface review-mined caveats ('Mosquitoes in late May', 'Loop C is loud') directly on results and as quoted chips with counts. The custom illustrated site map uses dots for sites, WC markers, hatched area for 'Generators allowed', and a callout label 'B30 · 25 m' for the selected site; site list rows have mini distance bars and night chips (Sat Sun Mon). Copy is novice-friendly ('New to camping?', 'Fits our group', tent pad definition). Compare modal (live) shows items as columns with BEST badges and shade bars and a 'Copy summary to share' button."
